# Practice: Calm Skies from the title's Practice (the setup's option list),
# a few flaps on Space, Undo (U) rewinds the last one, Escape pauses and
# Resume flies on; then no more flaps: the bird meets the sea, the results
# say so; R retries, Escape pauses the
# countdown and Leave round ends it as "headed home early"; Menu.
until 300 Play
frames 60
click Practice
until 60 Calm Skies
frames 10
expect endless, undo allowed, unranked
click Breezy
frames 10
click Calm Skies
frames 10
save practice-setup
click Start
frames 170
key Space 2
frames 30
key Space 2
frames 25
key Space 2
frames 10
save flying
frames 20
key KeyU 2
until 30 [soft rewind]
frames 5
save undone
key Escape 2
until 30 Paused
frames 10
save paused
click Resume
until 30 Pause
until 400 Flight ended
expect You met the sea.
frames 30
save practice-results
key KeyR 2
until 60 Calm Skies
frames 60
key Escape 2
until 30 Leave round
frames 10
click Leave round
until 60 You headed home early.
frames 10
click Menu
until 60 Play
